Z||000033||Doni Hagan||09-13-2001||02:10 AM||||My wife's from NYC and we spent the past two nights trying to find some of her family members. All of them have been accounted for. Most of them live in the Village (just downtown from the financial district.)Her friends are a different story. A couple of them haven't been heard from since the attack and we're certain they would've walked over there to see what was going on... It's only a few blocks away. <P>Anyway, I logged onto the Forum last night to kinda get my mind off things and saw the flag at half mast. Cliff, you're one hell of a classy SOB and I applaud you. ||||reg||14
